ios-redfin bridge patch 0164: spare image blocks, after UniXNU AdrenoMetal bridge patches 0021 (e0997b0, rpone), 0027 (59aabad) and
0030 (0f17e74, bluseliu50), BSD-2-Clause-Patent. Taken: spare dedicated image blocks, smallest fit with <= 1/4 left over, 10 s age,
spares freed when a block of their type cannot be made and on memory pressure (Device::release_kept_memory), 0027's byte bound
(256 MiB, knob). Not taken: 0021's room keeper thread, 0027's deferred-release thread and stage traces, 0030's room keeper use of spares.
Knobs (read once): SWEET_SPARE_IMAGES=1 (default off = as before), SWEET_SPARE_MS (10000), SWEET_SPARE_MB (256; 0030 = unbounded: large).

